    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d722">

                <pb facs="0951" n="849" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg849"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/2031: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-10-21T20:00:00+01:00">October 21, 1935—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 21—7:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>338. I have this evening received a communication addressed to the Secretary of
                    State by the President of the Committee of Coordination reading as follows:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Sir: As President of the Committee of Coordination of measures to be
                            taken under article 16 of the Covenant I have the honor to transmit
                            herewith to states non-members of the League, in accordance with the
                            decision of the Coordination Committee formed as the result of the
                            recommendation adopted by the Assembly on October 10, the principal
                            recent documents in the Italo-Ethiopian dispute, including the minutes
                            of the Council of October 7,<anchor n="54" xml:id="d722-f1"/> the
                            minutes of the Assembly of October 9 to 11<anchor n="55"
                                xml:id="d722-f2"/> and the recommendations of the Coordination
                                Committee.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d722-f3"/>
                        </p>
                        <p>I am instructed to add that the Governments represented on the
                            Coordination Committee would welcome any communication which any
                            non-member state may deem it proper to make to me, or notifications of
                            any action which it may be taking in the circumstances.</p>
                        <p>I have the honor to be, Sir, your obedient servant, Augusto de
                            Vasconcellos, President of the Committee.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>The documents attached to this communication are as follows:</p>
                <p>[Here follows list of League Documents previously submitted to the
                    Department.]</p>
                <p>Texts being mailed Steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Berengaria</hi> Ocober
                    23.</p>
                <closer>[File copy not signed.]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
